<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-048" chapter-id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers" source-id="s-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers-ws2493997">
  <p id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001:m0000" ref="d5x_77n_qxq">閑</persName>四子：<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001:m0004" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_B">厥</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001:m0006" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_C">絳</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001:m0008" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_D">完</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001:m0010" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">襄</persName>也。<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001:m0013" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_C">絳</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001:m0015" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_C">魏卿</persName>，時隨<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p001:m0020" ref="d5x_77n_qxq">閑</persName>，抱頸求代死，不獲，遂以身蔽刀刃，行刑者俱害之。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0000" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">襄</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0002" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">師卿</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0005" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_B">厥</persName>第四弟也。本名<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0013" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">衰</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0015" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">趙卿</persName>，有奏事者誤字為<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0025" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">襄</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0027" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf">梁武帝</persName>乃改為<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0033" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">襄</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p002:m0035" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">師卿</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p003:m0000" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_DA">雲公</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p003:m0003" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_DA">子龍</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p003:m0006" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">襄</persName>兄<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p003:m0008" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_D">完</persName>子也。<persName id="c-nanshi-048-luxiang-four-brothers:p003:m0012" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_D">完</persName>位甯遠長史、琅邪彭城二郡丞。</p>
</text>
